ultural Mix and Clash</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 1.5em; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times,=\"\" serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 15px;\"=\"\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">”</strong><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Aju Mukhopadhyay</strong><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"></strong></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 1.5em; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times,=\"\" serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 15px;\"=\"\">The Theme of dual Identity in Jhumpa Lahiris <em style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">The Namesake</em></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 1.5em; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times,=\"\" serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 15px;\"=\"\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">“Anisha Rajan</strong></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 1.5em; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times,=\"\" serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 15px;\"=\"\">Routing Relationships through Diaspora: Exploring the Short Fiction of Jhumpa Lahiri<br style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">“Priyanka Tripathi and H. S. Komalesha</strong></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 1.5em; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times,=\"\" serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 15px;\"=\"\">Shifting Identities: Problems  and Possibilities: A Study of Jhumpa Lahiris Fiction</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 1.5em; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times,=\"\" serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 15px;\"=\"\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">”</strong><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Sujatha S.</strong><strong style=\"margin: 0px; 