tom: 1.5em; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times,=\"\" serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 15px;\"=\"\">Beyond and Above Culture and Cultures</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 1.5em; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times,=\"\" serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 15px;\"=\"\">“V. V. B. Rama Rao</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 1.5em; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times,=\"\" serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 15px;\"=\"\">Feminism to Humanism:  Reflections of Contemporary Hindi Verse</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 1.5em; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times,=\"\" serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 15px;\"=\"\">“Prameela K. P.</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 1.5em; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times,=\"\" serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 15px;\"=\"\">Our Esteemed Contributors</p>', '1', '9b07f5011010.png', '', 1);
