y</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 1.5em; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times,=\"\" serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 15px;\"=\"\">a woman performs bravely!</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 1.5em; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times,=\"\" serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 15px;\"=\"\">Seleena Michael aged fifty one</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 1.5em; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times,=\"\" serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 15px;\"=\"\">lone cremator of Thrukkakkara</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 1.5em; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times,=\"\" serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 15px;\"=\"\">Municipal public crematorium</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 1.5em; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times,=\"\" serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 15px;\"=\"\">Cremating average twenty bodies monthly</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 1.5em; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times,=\"\" serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 15px;\"=\"\">Life with corpses for more than five years!</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 1.5em; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times,=\"\" serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 15px;\"=\"\">Two little daughters her assistants</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 1.5em; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times,=\"\" serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 15px;\"=\"\">Husband deserted a score year back</p><p style=\"margin-top: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 1.5em; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times,=\"\" seri