(51, 'Ananthu and the Miserable Kite', '<h1 style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 26px; font-family: Georgia, \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times,=\"\" serif;=\"\" font-style:=\"\" italic;=\"\" color:=\"\" rgb(51,=\"\" 51,=\"\" 51);\"=\"\"><br></h1><p style=\"margin-top: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 1.5em; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times,=\"\" serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 15px;\"=\"\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Ananthu and the Wretched Kite</strong></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 1.5em; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: \" times=\"\" new=\"\" roman\",=\"\" times,=\"\" serif;=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 15px;\"=\"\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"> </strong></p>Ananthukrishna, Gods innocent child<br><br>confronts with a kite, Gods own dear creation<br><br>No reason for spite or revenge<br><br>Little lad is chased by the kite<br><br>pecks him on head and back<br><br>on his journey to school and home<br><br>Compelled to go with parent and umbrella<br><br> <br><br>A fortnight ago some elder naughty boys<br><br>pelted stones at the wretched kite<br><br>Even wounded by a stone on its back<br><br>Boys fled away leaving Ananthu alone<br><br>Poor kite mistook him as assailant<br><br> <br><br>Accipitrine birds like kites, hawks, eagles,<br><br>God created them carnivores<br><br>Prey on birds, insects, animals for survival<br><br>Whereas we human beings<br><br>butcher animal world<br><br>not for existence but for taste<br><br>Nocturnal birds like bats and owls<br><br>ominous for us human beings<br><br> <br><br>When will we begin to love<br><br>kites, eagles, bats, owls<br><br>as we long for parrots, cuckoos,<br><br>skylarks and nightingales?<br><br>When will we stop the massacre<br><br>of animals, birds and fish<br><br>and learn to respect<br><br>other beings and their right to live?', '3', '', '2011', 1),
(52, 'International Journal on Multicultural Literature (IJML)', '<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">International Journal on Multicultural Literature (IJML)<br><br>Web Site: www.ijmljournal.com<br><br>(An International Refereed Biannual published in January and July)<br><br>ISSN    2231 “6248<br><br>Included in the UGC Approved list of Journals with journal number 42456<br><br>Abstracted and indexed by Literary Reference Centre Plus, EBSCO Host, USA<br><br>Edited and Published by: Dr. K. V. DOMINIC<br><br>Associate Editors: Dr. S. Kumaran, Dr. Ketaki Datta<br><br> <br><br>Unpublished and high quality critical articles on multicultural literature as well as reviews, interviews, poems and short stories are called for from the subscribers of IJML for the issues coming out in January and July. The submissions are subjected to double blind peer review. The referees are equipped with plagiarism alert software and the plagiarized articles will be summarily rejected.<br>Length of Submissions<br><br>    Critical Articles: Maximum 2500-3000 words or 8-10 pages<br>    Reviews: Maximum 1000-1500 words or 2-3 pages<br>    Interviews: Maximum 1500 words or 5 pages<br>    Poems: Maximum 2 pages for a poet<br>    Short Stories: Maximum 1800 words or 6 pages<br><br>The size of the letter for all submissions is: 12 in Times New Roman fond and the spacing is: 1.5. The writers should strictly follow MLA style of documentation, 8th edition (2016) for their critical articles. Book Reviews should be followed by copies of the original books sent to the Editor.<br>Deadline for Submissions<br><br>    For January issue: 30 October<br>    For July issue: 30 April<br><br>Only subscribers submissions will be published in the journal. Hence kindly take the subscription of the journal before you send your submissions.<br>Annual Subscription Rates:<br><br>    India                                       1500<br>    All other countries     US $ 50 or ‚¬ 40 or £ 35<br>    Kindle version:  500<br><br>The money can be remitted or transferred online. The account details are:<br><br>    ACCOUNT NO: 57069605722. CUSTOMER NAME: DOMINIC K V<br>    NAME OF BRANCH: SBI PBB THODUPUZHA. IFSC Code: SBIN0016887<br>    Kindly remit Rs. 57 more if the bank charges intercity charges from the subscription amount. The subscriptions can also be sent as MO to the editor. The address is given below.<br><br>All submissions shall be sent to the Editor by email attachment.  If acceptable, hard copies of the submissions should also be sent. Each submission should be accompanied by a certificate denoting that the submission is original and unpublished. The copy right of the journal articles is reserved to the Editor.<br><br>Address all correspondence to:<br><br>Dr. K. V. Dominic, Editor,<br>International Journal on Multicultural Literature,<br>XXI/439, Thodupuzha East P. O. Kerala, India “ 685 585.<br><br>Phone: 91+9947949159.<br>Email: prof.kvdominic@gmail.com,<br>Web Site: www.profkvdominic.com<br><br>Publication Details of the Journal<br><br>Name of the Journal: International Journal on Multicultural Literature (IJML)<br><br>ISSN Number: 2231“6248<br><br>Nature of Publication: Only Hard Copy<br><br>Periodicity: Biannual<br><br>Publisher: Dr. K. V. Dominic<br><br>City and Country: Thodupuzha, Kerala, India<br><br> <br><br>CHIEF EDITORS NAME AND ADDRESS<br><br> <br><br>Dr. K. V. Dominic,<br><br>Retired Professor of English,<br><br>Chief Editor of IJML,<br><br>Kannappilly House,<br><br>Thodupuzha East P.O.<br><br>Kerala “ 685585, India<br><br>Ph: 9947949259<br><br>Email: prof.kvdominic@gmail.com<br><br> <br><br>ASSOCIATE EDITORS NAMES AND ADDRESSES<br><br> <br><br>Dr. S. Kumaran<br><br>Associate Editor of WEC<br><br>Assistant Professor of English<br><br>PG and Research Department of English<br><br>Thiruvalluvar Government Arts College,<br><br>Rasipuram, Tamil Nadu, India<br><br>Pin: 637401<br><br>Ph: 9894851514<br><br>Email: kumaran_johnson2000@yahoo.co.in<br><br> <br><br> <br><br>Dr. Ketaki Datta<br><br>Associate Editor of WEC<br><br>Associate Professor of English<br><br>Bidhannagar Govt. College,<br><br>Salt Lake City, Sector 1, Kolkata 700064,<br><br>West Bengal, India<br><br>Ph: 9474520114<br><br>Email: ketaki.datta@gmail.com<br><br><br>    INSTRUCTIONS TO AUTHORS/REVIEWERS<br><br>Unpublished and high quality critical articles on multicultural literature as well as reviews, interviews, poems and short stories are called for from the subscribers of IJML for the issues coming out in January and July. The submissions are subjected to double blind peer review. The referees are equipped with plagiarism alert software and the plagiarized articles will be summarily rejected.</span>', '2', 'ddf902991091.jpg', '', 1),
(53, 'Writers Editors Critics (WEC)', '<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Writers Editors Critics (WEC) ISSN 2231-198X<br><br>Web site: www.writerseditorscritics.com<br><br>(GIEWEC€™s International Biannual Refereed Journal of English Language and literature, Published in March and September)<br><br>Abstracted and indexed by Literary Reference Centre Plus, EBSCO Host, USA<br><br>Editor-in-Chief: Dr. K. V. Dominic<br><br>Associate Editors: Dr. S. Kumaran, Dr. Ketaki Datta & Dr. Joji John Panicker<br><br> <br><br>High quality critical articles, reviews, interviews, poems and short stories from the members of the GIEWEC are published in the issues of WEC coming out in March and September. The critical articles are subjected to double blind peer review by a panel of Referees who are equipped with plagiarism alert software.<br><br>Patron membership fee of the Guild-cum-Journal is Rs. 6000, and Rs. 1200 for annual membership. The membership fees shall be remitted to the Guild€™s joint account at SBI Thodupuzha, Kerala. The details are given below.<br><br>    Account Holder€™s Name: GIEWEC<br>    Account Number: 32008434002<br>    Name of Branch: SBI Thodupuzha (Idukki District, Kerala)<br>    IFSC Code: SBIN0008674. SWIFT Code: SBININBB396<br><br>Membership fees may be remitted at SBI branches or transferred online or DD drawn in favour of GIEWEC, payable at Thodupuzha and sent by speed post to the Secretary. Kindly remit Rs. 57 more if the bank charges intercity charges from the subscription amount.<br><br>Subscription Rates:<br><br>FOR INDIVIDUALS<br><br>Patron: Rs. 6000 ($200, £ 150, ‚¬ 150). Annual: Rs. 1200 ($40, £ 30, ‚¬ 30). Three years: Rs. 3200. Five years: Rs. 5000<br><br>FOR INSTITUTIONS<br><br>Patron: Rs. 7500. Annual: Rs. 1500. Two years: Rs. 2500. Three years: Rs. 4000<br><br>FOR KINDLE VERSION (E-BOOK)<br><br>Rs. 500 ($20, £ 15, ‚¬ 15)<br> Length of Submissions<br><br>Critical Articles: maximum 3000 words, Short Stories: maximum 1800 words, Reviews: maximum 1500 words Interviews: maximum 1500 words, Poems: maximum 2 pages for a poet<br><br>The size of the letter for all submissions is: 14 in Times New Roman fond and the spacing is: 1.5. The writers should strictly follow MLA style of documentation, 8th edition (2016) for their critical articles. Book Reviews should be followed by copies of the original books sent to the Secretary. Each submission should be accompanied by a certificate denoting that the submission is original and unpublished. There should also be a declaration regarding the membership of the guild.<br>Deadline for Submissions<br><br>For March issue: 31 December, and for September issue: 30 June<br><br>Email copies of the submissions shall be sent to the secretary-cum-editor-in-chief, Dr. K. V. Dominic (Email: prof.kvdominic@gmail.com). Priority will be given to those members whose submissions have not been included in the issues already published. The copy right of the journal articles is reserved to the Editor.<br><br>Address all correspondence to:<br><br>Dr. K. V. Dominic, Secretary, GIEWEC<br><br>XXI/439, Thodupuzha East P. O.<br><br>Idukki Dt., Kerala, India €“ 685 585<br><br>Phone: 91+9947949159, Email: prof.kvdominic@gmail.com<br><br>Web Site: www.profkvdominic.com. Blog: www.profkvdominic.blogspot.in, www.giewecindia.com<br><br> <br><br>Publication Details of the Journal<br><br>Name of the Journal: Writers Editors Critics (WEC)<br><br>ISSN Number: 2231-198X<br><br>Nature of Publication: Only Hard Copy<br><br>Periodicity: Biannual<br><br>Publisher: Guild of Indian English Writers, Editors and Critics (GIEWEC)<br><br>City and Country: Thodupuzha, Kerala, India<br><br> <br><br>CHIEF EDITOR€™S NAME AND ADDRESS<br><br> <br><br>Prof. Dr. K. V. Dominic,<br><br>Retired Professor of English,<br><br>Chief Editor of WEC,<br><br>Kannappilly House,<br><br>Thodupuzha East P.O.<br><br>Kerala €“ 685585, India<br><br>Ph: 9947949259<br><br>Email: prof.kvdominic@gmail.com<br><br> <br><br>NAMES AND ADDRESSES MEMBERS OF EDITORIAL BOARD<br><br> <br><br>Prof. T. V. Reddy<br><br>Retired Professor  of English<br><br>Flat €“ 202, Brizvasi Apartments<br><br>Beside Ramachandra Mission,<br><br>    T. Road, Tirupati, A. P., India, Pin: 517 507<br><br>Ph: 8008860666, Email: vasudevareddyt@yahoo.com<br><br> <br><br>Dr. Jaydeep Sarangi,<br>Associate Professor of English,<br>Jogesh Chandra Chaudhuri College<br>30, Tollygunge, Prince Anwar Shah Road,<br><br>Kolkata-33, W. B. India, Ph: 09477807031<br><br>Email: jaydeepsarangi@gmail.com<br><br> <br><br>Dr. Shruti Das<br><br>Associate Professor English<br><br>P.G. Department of English,<br><br>Berhampur University<br><br>Odisha €“ 760007, Ph: 09438435130<br><br>Email: drshrutidas@gmail.com<br><br> <br><br>ASSOCIATE EDITORS€™ NAMES AND ADDRESSES<br><br> <br><br>Dr. S. Kumaran<br><br>Associate Editor of WEC<br><br>Assistant Professor of English<br><br>PG and Research Department of English<br><br>Thiruvalluvar Government Arts College,<br><br>Rasipuram, Tamil Nadu, India<br><br>Pin: 637401<br><br>Ph: 9894851514<br><br>Email: kumaran_johnson2000@yahoo.co.in<br><br> <br><br> <br><br>Dr. Joji John Panicker<br><br>Associate Editor of WEC<br><br>Assistant Professor of English<br><br>PG and Research Department of English<br><br>CMS College, Kottayam<br><br>Kerala, India, Pin: 686001<br><br>Ph: 9526781674<br><br>Email: jojipanicker@gmail.com<br><br> <br><br>Dr. Ketaki Datta<br><br>Associate Editor of WEC<br><br>Associate Professor of English<br><br>Bidhannagar Govt. College,<br><br>Salt Lake City, Sector 1, Kolkata 700064,<br><br>West Bengal, India<br><br>Ph: 9474520114<br><br>Email: ketaki.datta@gmail.com<br><br> <br><br> <br><br>    INSTRUCTIONS TO AUTHORS/REVIEWERS<br><br>High quality critical articles, reviews, interviews, poems and short stories from the members of the GIEWEC are published in the issues of WEC coming out in March and September. The critical articles are subjected to double blind peer review by a panel of Referees who are equipped with plagiarism alert software.<br><br>Patron membership fee of the Guild-cum-Journal is Rs. 6000, and Rs. 1200 for annual membership. The membership fees shall be remitted to the Guild€™s joint account at SBI Thodupuzha, Kerala. The details are given below.<br><br>    Account Holder€™s Name: GIEWEC<br>    Account Number: 32008434002<br>    Name of Branch: SBI Thodupuzha (Idukki District, Kerala)<br>    IFSC Code: SBIN0008674. SWIFT Code: SBININBB396<br><br>Membership fees may be remitted at SBI branches or transferred online or DD drawn in favour of GIEWEC, payable at Thodupuzha and sent by speed post to the Secretary.<br><br>Subscription Rates:<br><br>FOR INDIVIDUALS<br><br>Patron: Rs. 6000 ($200, £ 150, ‚¬ 150). Annual: Rs. 1200 ($40, £ 30, ‚¬ 30). Three years: Rs. 3200. Five years: Rs. 5000<br><br>FOR INSTITUTIONS<br><br>Patron: Rs. 7500. Annual: Rs. 1500. Two years: Rs. 2500. Three years: Rs. 4000<br><br> <br><br> Length of Submissions<br><br>Critical Articles: maximum 3000 words, Short Stories: maximum 1800 words, Reviews: maximum 1500 words Interviews: maximum 1500 words, Poems: maximum 2 pages for a poet<br><br>The size of the letter for all submissions is: 14 in Times New Roman fond and the spacing is: 1.5. The writers should strictly follow MLA style of documentation, 8th edition (2016) for their critical articles. Book Reviews should be followed by copies of the original books sent to the Secretary. Each submission should be accompanied by a certificate denoting that the submission is original and unpublished. There should also be a declaration regarding the membership of the guild.<br><br> <br><br>Deadline for Submissions<br><br>For March issue: 31 December, and for September issue: 30 June<br><br>Email copies of the submissions shall be sent to the secretary-cum-editor-in-chief, Dr. K. V. Dominic (Email: prof.kvdominic@gmail.com). Priority will be given to those members whose submissions have not been included in the issues already published. The copy right of the journal articles is reserved to the Editor.<br><br>Address all correspondence to:<br><br>Dr. K. V. Dominic, Secretary, GIEWEC<br><br>XXI/439, Thodupuzha East P. O.<br><br>Idukki Dt., Kerala, India €“ 685 585<br><br>Phone: 91+9947949159, Email: prof.kvdominic@gmail.com<br><br> <br><br>    PEER-REVIEW AND PUBLICATION POLICY OF THE JOURNAL<br><br>High quality critical articles, reviews, interviews, poems and short stories from the members of the GIEWEC are published in the issues of WEC coming out in March and September. The critical articles are subjected to double blind peer review by a panel of Referees who are equipped with plagiarism alert software.<br><br>    ETHICS POLICY OF THE JOURNAL<br><br>Each submission should be accompanied by a certificate denoting that the submission is original and unpublished. There should also be a declaration regarding the membership of the guild.<br><br> <br><br>    DECLARED FREQUENCY<br><br>High quality critical articles, reviews, interviews, poems and short stories from the members of the GIEWEC are published in the issues of WEC coming out in March and September.<br><br>    PAST ISSUES<br><br>The past issues of the journal came out in the due months March and September without fail.<br><br>(The publication dates of the past issues can be given with cover page)<br><br>    INDEXED  <br><br>Abstracted and indexed by Literary Reference Centre Plus, EBSCO Host, USA<br><br>    PUBLICATION CHARGES<br><br>No Publication Charges. The journal does not levy any submission or publication   charges<br><br>    YEAR OF ESTABLISHMENT<br><br>The Journal started regular publication from March 2011.</span>', '2', 'e8aac0121094.jpg', '', 1);
